    description: "`bakeoff-broad cohort --dry-run` raises AttributeError: line ~715 prints r.file_count and r.complexity_score, which bakeoff-broad's RepoInfo (name, path, size_bytes, size_mb, languages) does not have; the line matches bakeoff-deep, whose RepoInfo does. Repro 2026-11-12: init a throwaway session (--pool with one repo), then `cohort --dry-run --repos <repo>` -> AttributeError: 'RepoInfo' object has no attribute 'file_count'. Both auto-select and --repos paths reach the print; `loop --dry-run` does not. No test covers cohort --dry-run."  # 5799
