  message: "Fixed in PR #2153 (merged). The dry-run listing now prints name, size and languages, the fields bakeoff-broad's RepoInfo has. Behavioral evidence: tests/test_bakeoff_broad_cohort_dry_run.py runs cohort --dry-run --repos on a one-repo session in-process; it raised AttributeError at the listing before the fix and passes after (lists the repo, cohort number unchanged). No other RepoInfo read in the script names a missing field."  # 8074
